{"root":"getar","ipa":"/ɡətar/","core":"震动、颤动、振动，指物体或声音因受力而产生的快速往复运动。","pos":["动词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/ɡətar/","zh":"震动、颤动","phrases":[{"t":"getar suara","zh":"声带振动"},{"t":"getar bumi","zh":"地震震动"},{"t":"terasa getar","zh":"感到震动"}],"examples":[{"t":"Ponselnya bergetar di atas meja.","zh":"他的手机在桌子上震动。"},{"t":"Suaranya bergetar karena takut.","zh":"因为害怕，他的声音在颤抖。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"getar","ipa":"/ɡətar/","zh":"震动（原型词）","phrase":{"t":"getar nada","zh":"音调颤动"},"example":{"t":"Getar itu sangat halus.","zh":"那种震动非常细微。"}},{"w":"bergetar","ipa":"/bərɡətar/","zh":"震动着、颤抖着","phrase":{"t":"tangan bergetar","zh":"手在颤抖"},"example":{"t":"Jendela bergetar ditiup angin kencang.","zh":"窗户被大风吹得震动。"}},{"w":"getaran","ipa":"/ɡətarən/","zh":"震动（名词）、振动","phrase":{"t":"getaran gempa","zh":"地震波震动"},"example":{"t":"Getaran itu merusak bangunan.","zh":"那次震动损坏了建筑物。"}},{"w":"menggetarkan","ipa":"/məŋɡətar kan/","zh":"使震动、震慑","phrase":{"t":"menggetarkan jiwa","zh":"震撼心灵"},"example":{"t":"Pidatonya menggetarkan hati pendengar.","zh":"他的演讲震撼了听众的心。"}},{"w":"penggetar","ipa":"/pəŋɡətar/","zh":"振动器、震动源","phrase":{"t":"penggetar ponsel","zh":"手机振动器"},"example":{"t":"Alat penggetar ini rusak.","zh":"这个振动器坏了。"}}],"derSlugs":["getar","bergetar","getaran","menggetarkan","penggetar"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T02:50:55.018Z","src":"base"}